WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:04.340
And here you can see
all the numbers

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:06.955
for the EU countries compared.

00:00:06.955 --> 00:00:09.570
Gosh, that’s a lot of numbers!

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.500
Did you put all of that together?

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.280
No, they’re from the
EU Publications Office portal.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.730
Okay, then we can trust
the information.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:21.330
But there are so many numbers.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:24.690
There are also graphics
to display data.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.920
That’s nice!

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:31.580
Well, look at this for example:
when you look at the document,

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.910
it offers you more information
on the same topic.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:37.720
Is this also in Spanish?
- Of course!

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.090
Is the text also available in Dutch?

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:44.380
Ja, actually in all 24 EU languages.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:51.590
Well, this data looks great,
but can we use it for our app?

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:53.485
Yes, we can use it and…

00:00:56.445 --> 00:00:57.820
it’s for free.

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:02.040
You can find lots of information
about the EU

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.570
and what it does on
the EU Publications portal:

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:09.710
laws, research, open data,
publications and more.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:12.090
It’s child’s play.

